# Execution gates

- SKIP tecnico: `training` / `data` / `deploy` / `predict_error`
- Soft sinal (escopo **1.1**): SSOT `signal_skip` — mini/cal soft Kelly; sem flip pos-LOSS; sem hard SKIP de sinal
- Loss ML: container `aether-loss-classifier` → default soft graduado; log `LOSS_CLF || SOFT`
- `min_direction_margin` padrao **0.022** em **[0.015, 0.05]**; nao restaurar quality gate / Hurst/ADX/RSI/price_zone
- SCALE adapta lado + soft Kelly; **sem** SKIP por escala
- EXEC_EMPTY so tecnico / Kelly pause; catalogo: `docs/binary-senior-playbook.md` + `docs/infra-docker.md`
